WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.600
The subject is he and it is a habit: present simple in the third person.

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:16.700
“go” misses the -s for he. “going” would need “is” before it and would describe now, not a routine.

3
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:23.900
“He goes to work by bus”: go ends in o, so it adds -es.
